# Docs

`docs/MILESTONES.md` is the plan. `docs/BUILD.md` is the free-stack build. `docs/STATUS.md` is the snapshot. `docs/DECISIONS.md` is append-only ADRs. When a milestone exit is hit, update STATUS, MILESTONES, and DECISIONS in the same change.

No week numbers, sprint calendars, or "this week" headings. Milestones have exit criteria only.

Title facts belong in `docs/GAMES.md` plus `profiles/`.

Mogged is a desktop app. Do not describe it as a Wine/GPTK/CrossOver product. Zero paid software. Stack is in `docs/BUILD.md`.
